# A dart is not there to be fought (tests/fight/test_matchups.gd): a scan that
# reads one says so on the glass, once, as it opens.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/scan_dart.tour --seed=1 --hour=22 --weather=clear:0 --fit=scanner_lens
coast calm
place pinewood
wait 1.0
spawn warden
wait 1.2
tap ability_scan
await ability:scan 5
wait 0.4
shot 01-a-warden-read with mob:warden
